# SITL-ONLY: make the generic SITL plane fly at Tutor-like speed so turn and loiter GEOMETRY is comparable.
# The stock SITL plane cruises at ~22 m/s and flew a commanded 40 m loiter at ~86 m. The real Tutor has NO airspeed
# sensor; SITL gets a simulated one here only so TECS holds ~14 m/s. Navigation limits mirror the real FC backup.
ARSPD_TYPE 100
ARSPD_USE 1
AIRSPEED_CRUISE 14
AIRSPEED_MIN 11
AIRSPEED_MAX 20
ROLL_LIMIT_DEG 45
NAVL1_PERIOD 17
NAVL1_DAMPING 0.75
WP_LOITER_RAD 40
